        },
        {
          "text": "“Heapi ghayi nooyeanean lukghumeeda ea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda gweanyeew haradam ghayi oondeewi aba jeeda dareapcheeda? Ea fuga gheeh Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
